    "body": "# omp-spec-kit v1.0.2\n\n## Included changes\n\n- Promotes the bounded 10-tool MCP surface to the stable major release: 9 read-only tools and one transactional `spec_patch` authoring tool.\n- Preserves bounded entity, graph, document, evidence, and Markdown queries with pagination, projections, cursors, and traversal limits.\n- Verifies the complete semantic tool-E2E matrix against the built server and the exact release archive launcher.\n\n## Verified release\n\n- Candidate digest: `9993e9c1c58a4ed8c25da818353abeae9c524e506aecb4b9d839909da354ebe3`\n- Package tree digest: `ddf824e68d760d598ee40f5dc75d9b148bd2fd5637f6d58b574c52210375745d`\n- Archive SHA-256: `3483ea470e4a478b76ef9f48e9e2f63b1a43f03259140a8f1b4f7b645b778bca`\n- Peeled tag commit: `bdd4d99de57bfd167127d55339794b8eae6babe1`\n- OMP runtime: `18.0.11`\n- Distribution evidence: lifecycle producers, Docker BDD, manager discovery, and nine closed MRI receipts.\n\nInstall or upgrade at project scope, reload plugin metadata, then start a fresh OMP session before invoking MCP tools.\n"
